      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-orange-400 mb-2">V3 KVM Slices &mdash; 10Gbps, AMD EPYC Milan (latest gen)</h3>
      <ul class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-6 space-y-1">
        <li>&bull; V3 KVM Slice 2: 2 GB / 2 vCPU / 6TB / 60 GB NVMe &mdash; <strong>$4/mo</strong> (entry)</li>
        <li>&bull; V3 KVM Slice 4: 4 GB / 4 vCPU / 12TB / 120 GB NVMe &mdash; $6/mo</li>
